        "Other": {
          "description": "<p>The<i>PrimaryPartType</i>'<i>Other</i>' is used for parts that are described by a direct instance of<i>PartOrUsageRelatedSpecification</i>. These are parts that do not have a specific classification in the VEC and can be described with a<i>PartOrUsageRelatedSpecification</i>and<i>CustomProperties.</i>The corresponding<i>Role</i>is the<i>SpecificRole.</i></p>",
